Hello,

I've built a ShinyApp (hosted on an internal shiny server at my company). It's worked perfectly fine for over a month, but, as of today, is freezing on Google Chrome. It continues to work fine in Safari. Any thoughts on why this could be? My early guess is that Chrome is shutting down because it's asked to load what it considers to be too much data from the server, but I don't know if that's indeed the case.

And, fwiw, I've tried to use chrome's developer console to find something informative, but the page freezes before any insightful info can be displayed that way.

Thanks in advance!

-Lucas

