And in the javascript console in the browser:

leaflet.js:6 Uncaught TypeError: Cannot read property 'lat' of null

If those tables take some time to calculate and populate, you might need to increase the timeout(s) for the application, for example your idle timeout looks like it is 5 seconds right now.

